    "从刘海下方滑出一张卡片，带快捷动作；约 30 秒后自动收起（闹钟的陪它响完两分钟），指针停在上面时不收，按 Esc 关闭，点卡片打开对应的小组件面板。扩展栏隐藏、卡片不在当前布局时也会弹。关掉喝水时改回系统通知；关掉倒计时或闹钟时照样到点响，只是不弹卡片。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A card slides out below the notch with quick actions. It tucks away after about 30 seconds (an alarm's card stays for its two minutes of ringing), stays while the pointer is on it, closes with Esc, and opens the widget's panel when clicked. It appears even when the shelf is hidden or the widget is on another layout. Turning water off goes back to system notifications; turning the countdown or alarm off keeps them ringing, just without the card."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从备份中新增 %@ 个，替换 %@ 个。" : {
