    "令牌只保存在这台 Mac 的钥匙串中。未使用令牌时每小时只能请求 60 次，关注的项目较多时会自动放慢检查；添加令牌后上限提高到每小时 5000 次，并显示未读通知数。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The token is stored only in this Mac's Keychain. Without one, only 60 requests an hour are allowed and checks slow down when you watch many repos; with a token the limit is 5000 an hour and unread notifications are shown."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "令牌只保存在这台 Mac 的钥匙串中，用于提高请求上限并显示未读通知数。读取通知需要令牌具有 notifications 权限。" : {
