    "兑换码格式不对，应为 DKG-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX，请检查是否完整复制。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gift codes look like DKG-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX. Check that you copied all of it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "入口就是刘海本身，不占菜单栏的地方：指针移到刘海上，刘海下面会长出一小条显示小熊猫，点一下刘海或按快捷键才展开；回答生成中那一小条里是三个跳动的小点。外接屏的入口是菜单栏下方正中的小胶囊，平时半透明。「拾掇」在运行时刘海让给拾掇，码头不在刘海上放入口，请用快捷键或货架上 AI 卡片的小熊猫。灵动提示出现时入口暂时让位。货架上 AI 卡片的小熊猫打开的是同一个对话。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The entry is the notch itself and takes no menu bar space: move the pointer onto the notch and a small strip with the red panda grows below it. Click the notch or press the shortcut to open it; while an answer is generating, the strip shows three bouncing dots. On external displays the entry is a small capsule centered below the menu bar, semi-transparent until used. While Shiduo is running the notch is left to it, so use the shortcut or the red panda on the AI card in the shelf. The entry steps aside while a Live Alert is showing. The red panda on the AI card opens the same chat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
