    },
    "只有一个输出" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only one output"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只有程序坞预留了屏幕空间，窗口才会停在扩展栏边上，而这只有程序坞本身能做到。Docket 会把系统程序坞移到屏幕%@，关闭其自动隐藏，将其大小调整为与扩展栏一致，然后用扩展栏覆盖它。\n\n你当前的程序坞设置会被保存，在关闭此功能或退出 Docket 时恢复。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows only stop at the shelf's edge when the Dock reserves screen space, and only the Dock itself can do that. Dockling moves Apple's Dock to the %@ of the screen, turns off its auto-hide, sizes it to match the shelf and covers it with the shelf.\n\nYour current Dock settings are saved and restored when you turn this off or quit Dockling."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只看%@" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only %@"
