    "检测到「拾掇」正在运行：拾掇的悬浮暂存架在指针碰到刘海或把文件拖到刘海时弹出，为了不和它抢，码头不在刘海上放任何 AI 入口，刘海的点击和悬停都让给拾掇。这时请用快捷键或货架上 AI 卡片的小熊猫展开对话。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shiduo is running: its floating shelf pops out when the pointer touches the notch or a file is dragged there. To stay out of its way, Dockling puts no AI entry on the notch and leaves notch clicks and hovers to Shiduo. Use the shortcut or the red panda on the AI card to open the chat."
