    "码头所有音效的总开关和音量：添加和移除小组件时的轻响，以及提醒到点时的提示音。添加和移除的声音在系统设置里关闭了“播放用户界面音效”时不会播放。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One switch and volume for all of Dockling's sounds: the soft click when adding and removing widgets, and the chime when a reminder comes due. The add and remove sounds stay silent when \"Play user interface sound effects\" is off in System Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "码头更新了，助手也要更新一下，更新前上限暂不生效。" : {
