    "系统程序坞" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Dock"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统程序坞与扩展栏在同一边缘时，把扩展栏抬到程序坞之外。关闭后扩展栏会贴边并盖在系统程序坞上方。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When Apple's Dock is on the same edge, lift the shelf clear of it. When off, the shelf sits flush over the Dock."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统程序坞只能放在屏幕左侧、底部或右侧，无法在顶部为扩展栏预留空间。如需使用此功能，请先把扩展栏位置改为左侧、底部或右侧。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple's Dock can only sit on the left, bottom or right of the screen, so it can't reserve space for the shelf at the top. To use this, move the shelf to the left, bottom or right first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统程序坞布局" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Dock Layout"
          }
        }
      }
    },
