    "网页：在面板里打开官方网页，用你自己的账号，登录一次会记住。API：填了密钥后可选，兼容 OpenAI 的 /chat/completions 流式接口，密钥存在钥匙串里。跳转：打开 Mac App 或浏览器，和以前一样。豆包的 API 要填火山方舟的接入点 ID 作为模型名。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Web: open the official site in the panel with your own account; sign in once and it's remembered. API: available once a key is set, using an OpenAI-compatible /chat/completions streaming API, with the key in the Keychain. Jump: open the Mac app or browser, as before. Doubao's API needs a Volcano Ark endpoint ID as the model name."
          }
        }
      }
